"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1253538,"text":"しかし…おまえの研究の役に立つのか？","nextNodeIds":[110430309]},{"nodeId":110430309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":2399098530,"text":"ボクを困らせた問題は解決したよ。拠点に戻ったら、キミたちに面白いものを見せられるはずだよ。","nextNodeIds":[110430310]},{"nodeId":110430310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2755244690,"text":"こんな風に何かを研究したことは？","nextNodeIds":[110430311]},{"nodeId":110430311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":1160096186,"text":"その話をしたらキミは様々な変わったものと同類になるけど、それでもいいかい。","nextNodeIds":[110430312]},{"nodeId":110430312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":535218226,"text":"黄金、石化古樹、通常の8倍の太陽——","nextNodeIds":[110430313]},{"nodeId":110430313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":1245435586,"text":"本質を探究する過程は人を夢中にさせる。残念なのは、そういう夢中になれる時間が常に短いことだ。","nextNodeIds":[110430314]},{"nodeId":110430314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3432455130,"text":"ボクはボクの全てをかけても構わないけど、サンプルは限られてるからね。未知が徐々に既知になると、そういう面白さも消えていく。","nextNodeIds":[110430315]},{"nodeId":110430315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":447258994,"text":"最後はどれも夕暮れの実や、スイートフラワーのような存在になって、時間をかける価値もなくなる。","nextNodeIds":[110430316]},{"nodeId":110430316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4126166266,"text":"だからあのヒルチャールの絵にも、あんなに違いがあったんだな。","nextNodeIds":[110430317]},{"nodeId":110430317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":2013470570,"text":"ああ、ボクはあの時、「時間をかける価値はない」と言っただろ。ボクにとってもう興味がなかったからね。","nextNodeIds":[110430318]},{"nodeId":110430318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3775875746,"text":"じゃあ、この実験が終わったら、オイラたちもあんな風に…えっと、ただのラフ画になるのか？","nextNodeIds":[110430319]},{"nodeId":110430319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":4190853074,"text":"それなら心配ないよ、キミたちはボクの協力者、この恩は忘れないさ。","nextNodeIds":[110430320]},{"nodeId":110430320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":190302394,"text":"さて、拠点に戻る前に、最後の項目、知能に関する実験を終わらせようか。","nextNodeIds":[110430321]},{"nodeId":110430321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":1328257034,"text":"ついてきて、向こうにある遺跡に行くよ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1104303,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133002929"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1018"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[1104301,1104303,1104304],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","count":27},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":7},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":6}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[111043],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":331957294,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[11045],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":2017,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/LQ/Albedo1_11043/Q1104301","ANDJNFLIDIJ